title: Hold the Party Together
subtitle: Whatever happens in the streets, the party must come through it.
view-if: crisis = 1
on-arrival: month_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
new-page: true
tags: crisis

= Hold the Party Together

Couriers run between the Zentrale and the districts day and night. Some districts want to go further than the Zentrale, and some want to go home.

- @funds: Pass the hat in the works.
- @steady: Send the same order to every district.
- @let_go: Let each district judge for itself.

@funds
subtitle: 1 fund.
view-if: resources < 3
on-arrival: resources += 1

The collection tins come back fuller than anyone expected.

@steady
subtitle: The party acts as one. The districts that wanted more are held back.
on-arrival: {!
Q.unity += 5;
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] != Q.leading_faction) {
        Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] -= 3;
    }
}
!}

No adventures and no desertions: the order reaches every district within a day.

@let_go
subtitle: The angriest districts go as far as they like, and the Zentrale answers for it.
on-arrival: {!
for (var d of Q.districts) {
    if (Q['district_' + d + '_militancy'] >= 55) {
        RG.district(d, {militancy: 6, loyalty: 4, repression: 3});
    }
}
Q.unity -= 4;
Q.crisis_momentum += 3;
!}
